   "hash": "9f34afc9212bd25b",
   "does": "For ids Health had nothing for that are still queued (ids removed meanwhile, e.g. by Delete All My Data, are ignored and never written back): increments each id's miss counter; ids below maxAttempts are moved to the back of the queue, ids reaching maxAttempts are dropped from the queue and their counter removed.",
